abstract: >-
  Wave-2DGS augments each 2D Gaussian primitive with an explicit,
  view-independent sinusoidal RGB residual and learns selective utilization
  through group-sparse amplitude regularization.
keywords:
  - 2D Gaussian Splatting
  - novel-view synthesis
  - surface reconstruction
  - sinusoidal modulation
